- Utilizzo di *Context bounds*:
    - [`JsonCodec`](https://github.com/PPS-25-CFM/PPS-25-Sentinel/blob/34fa31ee2b28e2990bffb1cafb0d092e32910ffb/src/main/scala/it/unibo/sentinel/boundary/serialization/JsonSerialization.scala#L18)
    - [`FileRepository`](https://github.com/PPS-25-CFM/PPS-25-Sentinel/blob/34fa31ee2b28e2990bffb1cafb0d092e32910ffb/src/main/scala/it/unibo/sentinel/boundary/persistence/FileRepository.scala#L15)
- Utilizzo di *For-comprehension*:
