    - [`Phase`](https://github.com/PPS-25-CFM/PPS-25-Sentinel/blob/34fa31ee2b28e2990bffb1cafb0d092e32910ffb/src/main/scala/it/unibo/sentinel/core/simulation/Phase.scala)
    - [`Resolver`](https://github.com/PPS-25-CFM/PPS-25-Sentinel/blob/34fa31ee2b28e2990bffb1cafb0d092e32910ffb/src/main/scala/it/unibo/sentinel/core/collisions/Resolver.scala#L75)

